# ⚠️ This repo is PUBLIC and is served by GitHub Pages. Everything committed
# here is world-readable at connor-r.github.io/<path>, including files nothing
# links to. A Gmail app password lived in quotes/un_pw.csv for 5.5 months
# exactly this way (removed 2026-08-24) - .gitignore did NOT save it, because
# the file was already tracked when the ignore line was added. An ignore entry
# is not evidence a secret is out of the repo; `git ls-files` is.
#
